{"id":"G0796","lemma":"ἀστραπή","transliteration":"astrapē","sayIt":"astrapē","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, feminine","gloss":"lightning","meaning":"ἀστραπή, -ῆς, ἡ\n[in LXX for בָּרָק ;]\nlightning: Mat.24:27 28:3, Luk.10:18 17:24; pl., Rev.4:5 8:5 11:19 16:18; of a lamp, shining brightness, Luk.11:36.†\n(AS)","glosses":["lightning","flashes of lightning","shining"],"count":9,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"lightning","kjv":"the lightning"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"lightning","kjv":"ightning"}},{"chapterId":"luk-10","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"lightning","kjv":"lightning"}},{"chapterId":"luk-11","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"were shining","kjv":"the bright shining"}},{"chapterId":"luk-17","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"lightning","kjv":"the lightning"}},{"chapterId":"rev-4","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"flashes of lightning","kjv":"lightnings"}},{"chapterId":"rev-8","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"flashes of lightning","kjv":"lightnings"}},{"chapterId":"rev-11","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"flashes of lightning","kjv":"lightnings"}},{"chapterId":"rev-16","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"flashes of lightning","kjv":"lightnings"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Matthew 24:27","note":"For as the lightning flashes from the east, and is seen even to the west, so will the coming of the Son of Man be.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Luke 10:18","note":"He said to them, “I saw Satan having fallen like lightning from heaven.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Revelation 4:5","note":"Out of the throne proceed lightnings, sounds, and thunders. There were seven lamps of fire burning before his throne, which are the seven Spirits of God.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}